{"id":"mi_nimo","lemma":"mínimo","pos":"adj","rank":2021,"glosses":["minimal","smallest","least"],"ipa":"/ˈminimo/","forms":{"feminine":"mínima","masculinePlural":"mínimos","femininePlural":"mínimas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-m%C3%ADnimo.wav","examples":[{"text":"No me importa lo más mínimo.","en":"I couldn't care less.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703639","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"more"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"I don't care!"]]},{"text":"Hago lo mínimo que puedo para salir adelante.","en":"I do as little as I can to get by.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606649","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"for"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"to get ahead"]]},{"text":"El daño se mantuvo al mínimo.","en":"The damage was held to a minimum.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"damage"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to keep","l":"mantener"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Yo no tengo la más mínima intención de retirarme.","en":"I don't have the slightest intention of retiring.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64726","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"intention"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to remove","l":"retirar"}]},{"text":"¿Cuál es el salario mínimo en tu país?","en":"What's the minimum wage in your country?","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"wage, wages, salary"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"country"}]}]}